        "english": "In breathless anticipation of the monsoon of Saawan,\nMy longing eyes have turned to solid stone!\nYet in the ledger of our tragic destiny\nOnly the searing sun of grief was ever inscribed!",
        "commentary": "The yearning for Saawan (monsoon rains) as unattainable salvation."
