    "summary": "Using the leaf-plate (pattal) from community feasts to describe the discarded leftovers of a poet's life.",
    "backstory": "Inspired by Punjabi village wedding feasts where food was served on stitched banyan leaf platters.",
    "critiqueContext": "Rare blend of ritual feasting imagery with existential poverty.",
    "tarannumNote": "Solemn, low-register cadence.",
    "stanzas": [
      {
        "gurmukhi": "ਜੰਞ ਲੰਘ ਗਈ, ਮੇਲਾ ਮੁੱਕਿਆ,\nਪੱਤਲਾਂ ਰੁਲ਼ੀਆਂ ਧੂੜਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ!\nਕੋਈ ਨਾ ਪੁੱਛੇ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਫੁੱਲਾਂ ਨੂੰ,\nਜੋ ਸੜ ਗਏ ਦਿਲ ਦੀਆਂ ਝੂਰਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ!",
        "shahmukhi": "جنج لنگھ گئی، میلا مکیا،\nپتلاں رلیاں دھوڑاں وچ!\nکوئی نہ پچھے اوہناں پھلاں نوں،\nجو سڑ گئے دل دیاں جھوراں وچ!",
        "roman": "Janj langh gayi, mela mukkeya,\nPattlaan ruliyan dhooran vich!\nKoyi na puchhe ohnaan phullaan nu,\nJo sarh gaye dil diyan jhooraan vich!",
        "english": "The wedding procession has passed, the festival has ended,\nAnd the dried leaf-platters lie abandoned in the dust!\nNot a soul inquires after those withered flowers\nWhich smoldered away inside the heart's quiet sorrows!",
        "commentary": "The festive banquet leaves only discarded leaf plates blowing across the empty ground."
      },
      {
        "gurmukhi": "ਅਸੀਂ ਵੀ ਪੱਤਲ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਵਰਤੇ ਗਏ,\nਸਭ ਨੇ ਆਪਣਾ ਸਵਾਦ ਲਿਆ!\nਜਦ ਭੁੱਖ ਮਿਟੀ ਇਸ ਦੁਨੀਆ ਦੀ,\nਸਾਨੂੰ ਕੂੜੇ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਵਗਾਹ ਦਿੱਤਾ!",
        "shahmukhi": "اسیں وی پتل وانگوں ورتے گئے،\nسبھ نے اپنا سواد لیا!\nجد بھکھ مٹی اس دنیا دی،\nسانوں کوڑے وانگوں وگاہ دتا!",
        "roman": "Assin vi pattal vaangu varte gaye,\nSabh ne apna swaad liya!\nJad bhukkh mitti is duniya di,\nSaanu koorhe vaangu wagaah ditta!",
        "english": "We too were used like disposable leaf-platters—\nEveryone partook of our songs to satisfy their appetite!\nAnd once the hunger of this world was appeased,\nThey hurled us aside like refuse into the wind!",
        "commentary": "Devastating critique of how society consumes an artist's emotional output."
      },
      {
        "gurmukhi": "ਸ਼ਿਵ ਦੇ ਗੀਤ ਪਰ ਧੂੜ 'ਚ ਰੁਲ਼ ਕੇ ਵੀ,\nਆਪਣੀ ਮਹਿਕ ਨਾ ਛੱਡਣਗੇ!\nਜੋ ਲੱਭਣਗੇ ਇਤਿਹਾਸ ਪੰਜਾਬ ਦਾ,\nਉਹ ਸਾਡੇ ਨੈਣਾਂ 'ਚੋਂ ਕੱਢਣਗੇ!",
        "shahmukhi": "شیو دے گیت پر دھوڑ چ رل کے وی،\nاپنی مہک نہ چھڈنگے!\nجو لبھنگے تاریخ پنجاب دا،\nاوہ ساڈے نیناں چوں کڈھنگے!",
        "roman": "Shiv de geet par dhoor ch rul ke vi,\nApni mehak na chhaddange!\nJo labbhnge itihaas Punjab da,\nOh saade nainan chon kaddhnge!",
        "english": "Yet even trampled in the dust, Shiv's verses\nShall never surrender their undying fragrance!\nThose who seek the true, unvarnished history of Punjab\nShall have to dig it out from the tears of our eyes!",
        "commentary": "His poetry stands as the emotional chronicle of Punjab's inner life."
      }
    ],
