        "shahmukhi": "کرناں نچن کندھاں اتے،\nساڈے دل تے چھریاں چلن وے!\nاس چانن دے میلے وچ،\nساڈے ساہ انگیاڑاں چ بلن وے!",
        "roman": "Kirnaan nachan kandhaan utte,\nSaade dil te chhuriyaan challan ve!\nIss chanan de mele vich,\nSaade saah angiyaaraan ch balan ve!",
        "english": "Sunbeams dance playfully upon the mud-plastered walls,\nYet their dance cuts like jagged daggers across our heart!\nAmidst this joyous carnival of morning radiance,\nOur breath smolders like embers in a deserted hearth!",
        "commentary": "Daggers of light (chhuriyaan) cutting across the mourning soul."
