        "roman": "Virlaap kare meri rooh ajj saari,\nKoyi na hanjhu poonjhan aavega!\nMere maran te eh zaalim duniya,\nJhoothe hanjhu vahaavega!",
        "english": "My entire soul raises an unceasing, desolate lament,\nKnowing full well that none will step forward to wipe these tears!\nYet upon my death, this very callous, hypocritical world\nWill stage grand mourning with counterfeit saltwater tears!",
