        "shahmukhi": "میں پنجاب دی دھرتی توں،\nجو پیڑاں دا وردان لیا!\nاوہ شبداں دے وچ ڈھال کے میں،\nہر دردیلے نوں دان دتا!",
        "roman": "Main Punjab di dharti ton,\nJo peerran da vardaan liya!\nOh shabdaan de vich dhaal ke main,\nHar dardeele nu daan ditta!",
        "english": "From the sacred soil of Punjab,\nWhatever blessing of agony I was granted,\nI forged into immortal living words\nAnd distributed freely as alms to every suffering soul!",
        "commentary": "Suffering as a spiritual blessing (vardaan) shared generously with humanity."
