    "summary": "The cremation ground (Shamshaan) is portrayed as the only place of true equality, where all pride and power turn to cooling grey ash.",
    "backstory": "Composed in Batala during solitary walks past the cremation ground on the town outskirts.",
    "stanzas": [
      {
        "gurmukhi": "ਮੈਂ ਸ਼ਮਸ਼ਾਨ ਦੀ ਰਾਖ਼ 'ਚ ਵੇਖਿਆ,\nਸਭ ਹੰਕਾਰ ਮਿੱਟੀ ਹੋ ਗਏ!\nਜੋ ਕਹਿੰਦੇ ਸੀ ਅਸੀਂ ਬਾਦਸ਼ਾਹ ਹਾਂ,\nਉਹ ਵੀ ਇੱਕੋ ਚਿਤਾ 'ਚ ਸੋ ਗਏ!",
        "shahmukhi": "میں شمشاں دی راکھ چ ویکھیا،\nسبھ ہنکار مٹی ہو گئے!\nجو کہندے سی اسیں بادشاہ ہاں،\nاوہ وی اکو چتا چ سو گئے!",
        "roman": "Main shamshaan di raakh ch vekheya,\nSabh hankaar mitti ho gaye!\nJo kehnde si aseen baadshah haan,\nOh vi ikko chita ch so gaye!",
        "english": "Looking into the cooling ashes of the cremation ground,\nI saw all human arrogance and vanity dissolved into dust!\nThose who proclaimed themselves emperors and monarchs\nSlept quietly within the very same heap of gray cinders!",
        "commentary": "The great leveller: the pyre erases all worldly hierarchy."
      },
      {
        "gurmukhi": "ਇਸ ਰਾਖ਼ 'ਚ ਕੋਈ ਜਾਤ ਨਾ ਦਿਸਦੀ,\nਨਾ ਕੋਈ ਅਮੀਰ ਨਾ ਗ਼ਰੀਬ ਨੀ!\nਜੋ ਅੱਗ ਨੇ ਸਾੜ ਕੇ ਪਾਕ ਕੀਤਾ,\nਉਹੀ ਰੂਹ ਦਾ ਨਸੀਬ ਨੀ!",
        "shahmukhi": "اس راکھ چ کوئی ذات نہ دسدی،\nنہ کوئی امیر نہ غریب نی!\nجو اگ نے ساڑ کے پاک کیتا،\nاوہی روح دا نصیب نی!",
        "roman": "Iss raakh ch koyi jaat na dissdi,\nNa koyi ameer na gareeb ni!\nJo agg ne saarh ke paak keeta,\nUhi rooh da naseeb ni!",
        "english": "Within these ashes, no trace of caste or lineage remains;\nNeither the billionaire nor the destitute pauper can be told apart!\nThat which the sacred fire purified and reduced to ash\nAlone represents the true, unburdened destiny of the spirit!",
        "commentary": "Fire as the ultimate purifier of social falsehoods."
      },
      {
        "gurmukhi": "ਸ਼ਿਵ ਵੀ ਇਸੇ ਰਾਖ਼ 'ਚ ਰਲ਼ ਜਾਊ,\nਇਹ ਸੋਚ ਕੇ ਦਿਲ ਮੁਸਕਾਉਂਦਾ ਏ!\nਜੋ ਬਿਰਹਾ ਦੀ ਅੱਗ 'ਚ ਸੜਿਆ ਸੀ,\nਉਹ ਅਮਰ ਸੁੱਖ ਹੁਣ ਪਾਉਂਦਾ ਏ!",
        "shahmukhi": "شیو وی اسے راکھ چ رل جاؤ،\nایہہ سوچ کے دل مسکاوندا اے!\nجو برہا دی اگ چ سڑیا سی،\nاوہ امر سکھ ہن پاوندا اے!",
        "roman": "Shiv vi isse raakh ch ral jaau,\nEh soch ke dil muskaaunda ae!\nJo birha di agg ch sarheya si,\nOh amar sukkh hun paaunda ae!",
        "english": "Shiv too shall dissolve into these very gray ashes;\nPondering this final grace, his weary heart smiles in peace!\nHe who burned through an entire lifetime in the fire of separation\nNow attains at last the everlasting sanctuary of silence!",
        "commentary": "Peace found in total dissolution."
      }
    ],
