        "roman": "Eh jaam vi khaali ho jaavega,\nJadon raat da antam pehar ho-oo!\nPhir Shiv da naan koyi nahin lavega,\nJad maut da chaare paase shehar ho-oo!",
        "english": "This earthen wine goblet too will be drained to the bottom\nWhen the final, darkest watch of midnight arrives!\nAnd then no voice will utter the name of Shiv in this hall,\nWhen the silent city of Death has enclosed us on every side!",
        "commentary": "Classical ghazal maqta (signature line) invoking his own pen name (*Shiv*)."
