        "roman": "Hanera chhaa gaya chaare paase,\nKoyi raushni di kiran na rahi!\nSaadi jind vi usse shama vaangoo,\nJis vich jiyun di taangh na rahi!",
        "english": "Suffocating darkness has descended upon the empty chamber,\nNot a single ray of radiant light has survived!\nOur fragile life was identical to that dying candle,\nWithin whose burnt wick no yearning for survival remained!",
