        "roman": "Puran:\nmaae !\niਸ dhrtee de jaae\nਸbh ljiaa dee joone aae\nithe ਹr koee\naapnee nzr 'chon iun dig jaae\nki ਸaanoon aapnaa aap\nnaa aapne kol bithaae\nਸaathon ਸaadaa aapnaa aap\nnzr bchaae\nਸaathon Saade bhet chhupaae\naapaa aapne kolon drdaa\nkidhre ਸaanoon bhnd naa aae\nਸaanoon ਸaathon ਹee bo aae\nithe ਸbh kujh jnmnon pਹilaan\nਹee mr jaae\nmr ke ਹee ਹr koee\niਸ dhrtee 'te aae\naapnee aape laash noon\naapne modheen chaa ke\nਹr koee aapnee aapnee\nethe audh ਹndhaae\nmitee noon bਸ mitee khaae\nmitee noon mitee prnaae\nmitee grbhvtee ਹo jaae\nmitee jnme te mr jaae\nchauraaਸee daa chkr laae\nmitee mnukh naam dhraae\nmitee ਸaare paap kmaae\nmitee dee kujh ਸmjh naa aae\nkiਸ mntv lee jnme jaae\niਸ dee vithiaa kਹee naa jaae\nchngaa Hai Je meree mitee\neਸ jnm ton muktee paae\nte nir-ljit ਹee mr jaae\nmaithon mainoon laaj naa aae\nPuran ਹr Jeevan daa\nik prteek Hai maae\npitaa jidਹaa Salwan\nਸdaa vaariਸ ਸdvaae\nPar Jeevan noon ਸmjh naa paae\nte Ichhran ਹr Jeevan dee\njnnee kਹilaae\njnnee jo Jeevan noon\naapnee rt chunghaae\npeerh dee umraa bhogn aae\nte Loona, Jeevan de raaਹ dee\naiਸee bhtkn\naiਸee arhchn\njiਹrhee Jeevan noon khaa jaae\ndhur ton aave likhee likhaae\naiਸaa rorhaa\naiਸaa pthr\nchaaਹiaan, an-chaaਹiaan vee jiਸ ਸng\nਹr koee aiਸaa thedaa khaae\nJeevan ang-ਹeen kr jaae\nJeevan 'chon Jeevan mr jaae\nphir Jeevan noon kujh naa ਸujhe\nSuraj gin gin umr vnnyaae\naape ton nfrt ਹo jaae\nlokaan daa uਹnoon ਸaath naa bhaae\nknde ton kndaa naa lge\nphulaan 'chon khushbo naa aae\nmurh Jeevan 'chon jeeaa naa jaae\nuਸ noon aapnaa aapaa khaae\nmaae !\nAgg dee baat ਸulgdee\nmain chaaਹundaa ਹaan ਸulg ਹee jaae\nmainoon ang-ਹeen kr jaae\nTaan jo koee Salwan murh\nnaa Dhee prnaae\nkoee Babul naa\naapnee Dhee daa pindaa khaae\nTaan jo ਹr koee\naapnaa aapnaa ਹaan ਹndhaae\nDhee prnaaee Babul viਹrhe\nnaa murh jaae\nTaan jo murh koee Ichhran naa\njioondee mr jaae\nkoee Dhee murh Babul dee\npg noon mail naa laae\nmurh naa koee Loona\nmnge ang praae\nkiਸe vee Loona daa murh\njobn naa rul jaae\ndhn de ke, murhਹ ethe naa\nkoee tn noon khaae\nmurh naa koee Puran\nang-ਹeen ਹo jaae\nkoee pitaa naa,\nmurh Puttar de ang ktaae\nkoee Puran murh piaar-vichhunnaa\nnaa mr jaae\nkoee Puran murh Jeevan jioonon\nmoonਹ naa chaae\nphir koee Puran\nPuran ton naa nfrt khaae\nphir koee Puran\nPuran kolon dr naa jaae\nphir Puran noon\nPuran kolon bo naa aae\niਸ dhrtee daa ਹr bndaa\nik bndaa ਹove\niਸ dhrtee dee ਹr naaree\nnaaree kਹilaae\nmain chaaਹundaan Puran mr jaae\nmr ke aiਸaa chinnਹ bn jaae\njiਸ noon prhਹ ਸun ke ਹr koee\naapne raaਹ ton bhtk naa jaae\n( Salwan te loonaan, Puran te Ichhran vl vdhde Han .)",
