        "roman": "Shiv taan peenda ae bhullan khaatar,\nPar yaadaan hor vi jaagdiyaan ne!\nJinna zehar andar uttarda,\nOniyan peerran dil nu laagdiyaan ne!",
        "english": "Shiv drinks only to purchase temporary oblivion,\nYet memories awake with all the fiercer intensity!\nThe deeper the burning liquor sinks into the bloodstream,\nThe sharper the spears of grief pierce through the heart!",
