        "roman": "Mera sur ajj zakhmi hoyea,\nGale chon lahoo nikalda ae ni!\nJo geet kade main gaaunda si,\nOh agg vaangoo sulagda ae ni!",
        "english": "My musical note has been mortally wounded today,\nBlood trickles from the quarry of my singing throat!\nThose melodious songs I once sang with radiant ease\nNow smolder within like unquenchable, choking embers!",
