        "roman": "Akhiyaan patthar ho gaiyaan saadiyaan,\nKoyi roop na hun disda ae ve!\nIss chup di doonghi khaayi vich,\nKoyi bhed na hun risda ae ve!",
        "english": "Our weeping eyes have turned to solid marble stone,\nNo earthly beauty can register upon their glazed surface!\nWithin this bottomless, sacred abyss of silence,\nNo secret drop of blood oozes from our wounds!",
